From: binsquare <hebinsquared@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] tsi: route host-network sockets through the host transport

Route host-network sockets through the VMM and acknowledge UDP sends
with Linux errors.

Signed-off-by: binsquare <hebinsquared@gmail.com>
---
